## 3. Summary of Engineering Takeaways
1. **Communication & Git Hygiene:** The Recruiter Dashboard overlap taught me the importance of locking down ticket assignments on our board before writing code. When the overlap happened, prioritizing repository stability over sunk-cost code—and pivoting to uncompleted backlog items—kept our Sprint 3 release clean.
2. **Defense-in-Depth Validation:** Pairing strict `HS256` JWT validation in `authenticateUser` with per-field boundary checks and SQL unique constraints ensures that invalid states are caught early with clear HTTP status codes (`400`, `401`, `404`, `409`, `503`).
